ClientError\/pinRejected(retriesRemaining:source:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and the caller","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"decides whether to re-prompt and retry with a fresh ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Returning ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization\/PINReply\/cancel","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" from ","type":"text"},{"code":"providePIN","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" aborts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ceremony with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientError\/cancelled(source:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a high-level passkey client that runs WebAuthn ceremonies against a YubiKey.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the entry point for WebAuthn in this SDK. It wraps a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and translates W3C WebAuthn requests into CTAP2 protocol exchanges — building the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientDataJSON","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", validating the relying-party identifier against the configured","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, a